Speaking [LangChangeCommand ('en_US'), "TSDR TRADING Server Tag: UCTRole icon, Contributor Contributor , Welcome to #free-room-notes, the free corner of Uncharted Territory. What lands here: A short teaser from the Morning Wire before the open , Sunday Scans, our prep for the week ahead, every weekend , Invites to the occasional free open session: live on Zoom with TSDR and Bracco before the 9:30 AM ET open , What members get on top: the live morning Zoom every market day, each trader's own channel, options flow and news all day, every session recorded with a recap the same day, years of workshops, and a free 1-on-1 call to get set up. Want in? https://whop.com/c/uncharted/discord-free Questions? Ask in here and someone from the team will answer. Education only, not financial advice. Whop Uncharted Territory: Live Trading Room **Every market morning, live** About 20 minutes before the 9:30 AM ET open, co-founders TSDR (Patrick) and Bracco go live on Zoom. They lay out the plan and the levels, then trade the open on screen share and talk through every decision. **The traders** - **TSDR and Bracco**: run the morning Zoom and wrote the strategy book - **ChartMaster**: s... Uncharted Territory: Live Trading Room , 10/5/2026 1:59 PM"]
